marter model can still nail in one shot the answer a billion-token group chat could not argue its way to. Saving money and top-tier intelligence are not in conflict. 硅谷101 硅谷101 E249｜Token经济转点：OpenClaw、Hermes到本地自研的Agent进化之路 Token Economics Agent Engineering Open-Source Models Local Deployment B2B Startups Infrastructure Investing OpenClaw Agentic Loop FDE (Forward Deployed Engineer) Agent Native Jevons Paradox Gödel machine\" href=\"/podcast/en/p/2026-08-20-sv101-堆agent烧token是过渡策略-不是终局/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://media24.fireside.fm/file/fireside-images-2024/podcasts/images/f/f0f20376-8faf-4940-b920-84af6c734e2d/cover.jpg?v=6\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"cn\"><span class=\"src\" lang=\"zh\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>Burning tokens to stack up agents is a transitional strategy, not the endgame</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Silicon Valley is shifting from mindless token burning to careful accounting: a local open-source model can do real work on a dollar a day of electricity, yet when a genuinely hard problem shows up, a smarter model can still nail in one shot the answer a billion-token group chat could not argue its way to. Saving money and top-tier intelligence are not in conflict.</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> Points</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> Quotes</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Token Economics</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent Engineering</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\"\n data-hay=\"Britain knew nothing about Northern Ireland, and hardline arson dragged Ireland toward civil war The Northern Ireland conflict was not simple sectarian hatred: Britain&#x27;s information vacuum, loyalist arson staged on purpose, and the civil rights movement&#x27;s genuine grievances amplified one another and together pulled Ireland toward civil war. The Rest Is History The Rest Is History 698. The Troubles: The Brink of Civil War (Part 2) Northern Ireland conflict civil rights movement British politics Irish history escalation of violence RUC / Royal Ulster Constabulary UVF / Ulster Volunteer Force NICRA / Northern Ireland Civil Rights Association B Specials\" href=\"/podcast/en/p/2026-08-19-restishistory-英国的一无所知与强硬派的纵火把北爱推向内战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://megaphone.imgix.net/podcasts/00c0a118-2426-11ee-b258-73d331d0123b/image/db3295fcd9d3a7113e8000e931f0541d.jpg?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&amp;max-w=3000&amp;max-h=3000&amp;fit=crop&amp;auto=format,compress&amp;w=400&amp;auto=format\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>Britain knew nothing about Northern Ireland, and hardline arson dragged Ireland toward civil war</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">The Northern Ireland conflict was not simple sectarian hatred: Britain&#x27;s information vacuum, loyalist arson staged on purpose, and the civil rights movement&#x27;s genuine grievances amplified one another and together pulled Ireland toward civil war.</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> Points</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> Quotes</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Northern Ireland conflict</span><span class=\"tag\">civil rights movement</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"cn\"\n data-hay=\"Adidas Bottoms Out: Reheating Old Hits Beats Superstar Collabs After nearly halving from its 2021 peak, Adidas engineered an earnings recovery by thawing out its retro sneakers, repairing its wholesale partners and holding inventory on a tight leash — but the share price rallied and then fell back again, showing that the sportswear cycle is really a game played between inventory and expectations. 商业就是这样 商业就是这样 Vol.271 阿迪达斯如何触底反弹？ Adidas Sportswear Inventory management Share price cycles Retro sneakers Consumer goods Samba Months of supply Write-down provision Sub-two\" href=\"/podcast/en/p/2026-08-19-bizthisway-阿迪达斯触底反弹-炒冷饭比巨星联名更稳/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://fdfs.xmcdn.com/storages/16ad-audiofreehighqps/A7/4F/GKwRIW4J7XyNAAdKlwLE2MK_.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-initial=\"商\"><span class=\"dur\">28:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"cn\"><span class=\"src\" lang=\"zh\">商业就是这样</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>Adidas Bottoms Out: Reheating Old Hits Beats Superstar Collabs</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">After nearly halving from its 2021 peak, Adidas engineered an earnings recovery by thawing out its retro sneakers, repairing its wholesale partners and holding inventory on a tight leash — but the share price rallied and then fell back again, showing that the sportswear cycle is really a game played between inventory and expectations.</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> Points</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> Quotes</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Adidas</span><span class=\"tag\">Sportswear</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\"\n data-hay=\"AI Is Devaluing Code; an Engineer&#x27;s Moat Is Taste and Accountability Addy Osmani, who leads Chrome DevTools, argues that AI has devalued writing code and that an engineer&#x27;s real edge is taste and accountability — and warns against cognitive surrender, treating the AI&#x27;s answer as your own. The Pragmatic Engineer The Pragmatic Engineer From Chrome DevTools to AI Engineering, with Addy Osmani Chrome DevTools AI engineering Cognitive surrender Taste as moat Career change Frontend cognitive surrender alpha unbundling\" href=\"/podcast/en/p/2026-08-19-pragmatic-ai-时代工程师的护城河是品味与问责/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/feed/podcast/458709/post/211500766/c851926365279756d825ead10add906c.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Pragmatic Engineer</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI Is Devaluing Code; an Engineer&#x27;s Moat Is Taste and Accountability</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Addy Osmani, who leads Chrome DevTools, argues that AI has devalued writing code and that an engineer&#x27;s real edge is taste and accountability — and warns against cognitive surrender, treating the AI&#x27;s answer as your own.</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> Points</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> Quotes</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Chrome DevTools</span><span class=\"tag\">AI engineering</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\"\n data-hay=\"An AI Companion at $4M a Year: No Scripted Plot, Just Memory and Improvisation Tolon, the AI companion from Portola, threw out scripted plots and character sheets: memory is the character sheet, generation is improvisation, and the product is now at $4M in annualized revenue. This &quot;improv actor&quot; methodology and its mixed-model strategy are a second product path alongside ChatGPT. AI &amp; I AI &amp; I（Every） The AI Alien Companion App That&#x27;s Bringing In $4M a Year (Best of the Pod) AI Companions Improv Narrative Product Methodology LLM Applications Startups judge prompt lower seeds situations daemon\" href=\"/podcast/en/p/2026-08-19-aiandi-ai-伴侣不做预设-记忆即角色-年入-400-万美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://img.transistorcdn.com/_unLmYM9CjKDeRXJOn7gFK3H6X2dny3KX6lhn0gohkg/rs:fill:0:0:1/w:1400/h:1400/q:60/mb:500000/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWct/dXBsb2FkLXByb2R1/Y3Rpb24udHJhbnNp/c3Rvci5mbS8yNDM2/YzU4NDNmYTQxNTJh/MTEzYjE4YmJmYTg5/ODY1NS5wbmc.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>An AI Companion at $4M a Year: No Scripted Plot, Just Memory and Improvisation</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tolon, the AI companion from Portola, threw out scripted plots and character sheets: memory is the character sheet, generation is improvisation, and the product is now at $4M in annualized revenue. This &quot;improv actor&quot; methodology and its mixed-model strategy are a second product path alongside ChatGPT.</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> Points</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> Quotes</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI Companions</span><span class=\"tag\">Improv Narrative</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\"\n data-hay=\"An AI Companion Made $4M in Four Weeks: 500ms More Latency and It Falls Apart Tolen, an AI alien companion, took ARR from $10,000 to $4M in four weeks — but add 500 milliseconds of latency and every metric collapses. Growth comes from viral video; retention comes from treating the AI as a narrative medium rather than a tool. Every Every $4M in 4 Weeks: How This AI Alien Companion App Took Off (Best of the Pod) AI companionship Viral growth Latency Model selection Narrative design Evals Big Five vibe prompting judge prompt character-driven computing\" href=\"/podcast/en/p/2026-08-19-every-4周破400万美元-ai伴侣的爆红与500ms陷阱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://i3.ytimg.com/vi/ngTS4gUINVk/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Every</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>An AI Companion Made $4M in Four Weeks: 500ms More Latency and It Falls Apart</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tolen, an AI alien companion, took ARR from $10,000 to $4M in